<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>sci~art Poster</title>
<style>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px;
    background-color: #e9ecef;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .poster-container {
    width: 850px;
    background-color: #f7f8f3;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    padding-bottom: 40px;
    font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
  }

  /* Header Section */
  .header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 50px;
  }
  .main-title {
    font-family: 'Arial Black', sans-serif;
    font-size: 150px;
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -4px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .title-sc { color: #000; }
  .title-i { 
    color: #5c2d91; 
    font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
    font-size: 140px;
    margin: 0 15px;
  }
  .title-tilde { 
    color: #000; 
    font-size: 90px;
    margin: 0 10px;
    transform: translateY(-15px);
  }
  .title-a { 
    color: #d1121a; 
    font-size: 160px;
    margin: 0 10px;
    transform: translateY(10px);
  }
  .title-rt { color: #000; }

  .subtitle {
    font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
    font-size: 28px;
    color: #222;
    margin-top: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  /* Middle Section */
  .middle-section {
    position: relative;
    height: 550px;
    margin-top: 40px;
  }
  .intro-text {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50px;
    left: 70px;
    width: 480px;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 26px;
    color: #4a235a;
    line-height: 1.6;
    z-index: 10;
  }
  .main-image-placeholder {
    position: absolute;
    top: 100px;
    right: -20px;
    width: 700px;
    height: 480px;
    background-color: rgba(200, 200, 200, 0.2);
    border: 2px dashed #999;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #555;
    font-family: sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* Bottom Columns */
  .columns-section {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 0 70px;
    margin-top: 30px;
    gap: 40px;
  }
  .column {
    flex: 1;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #111;
  }
  .col1 {
    text-align: left;
  }
  .col2 {
    text-align: left;
  }
  .col3 {
    text-align: right;
  }
  .col3-top {
    font-style: italic;
    margin-bottom: 35px;
  }
  .col3-bottom {
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .logo-placeholder {
    width: 65px;
    height: 65px;
    border: 1px dashed #999;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 10px;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 20px auto 0;
    font-family: sans-serif;
  }

  /* Footer */
  .footer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 50px;
    padding: 0 70px;
  }
  .footer-red-box {
    background-color: #d1121a;
    color: white;
    padding: 8px 18px;
    font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .footer-text {
    color: #d1121a;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-left: 15px;
  }

  .placeholder {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="poster-container">

  <div class="header">
    <div class="main-title">
      <span class="title-sc">sc</span><span class="title-i">i</span><span class="title-tilde">~</span><span class="title-a">a</span><span class="title-rt">rt</span>
    </div>
    <div class="subtitle">Call for ideas from partnerships in science and art</div>
  </div>

  <div class="middle-section">
    <div class="intro-text">
      Can you bring the insights of science<br>
      and art closer together with an idea<br>
      that captures the public's imagination?
    </div>
    <div class="main-image-placeholder placeholder">
      [Image: Red artist's palette with test tubes containing purple liquid]
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="columns-section">
    <div class="column col1">
      The Wellcome Centre is providing funds for developing the ideas of scientists and artists working in partnership. Three to six ideas may be funded with amounts ranging from £5000 to £50 000.
    </div>
    <div class="column col2">
      Scientists and artists with an active interest in the subjects of biology, medicine and health (including mental health) are invited to submit their ideas to SCI~ART.
      <div class="logo-placeholder placeholder">
        [Logo:<br>The Wellcome<br>Trust]
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="column col3">
      <div class="col3-top">
        For details of how to enter SCI~ART see reverse,<br>
        or call 0171 611 8289. The closing date for<br>
        entries is 14 February 1997
      </div>
      <div class="col3-bottom">
        The Wellcome Trust is a<br>
        registered charity, no. 210183
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <div class="footer-red-box">
      THE WELLCOME CENTRE FOR MEDICAL SCIENCE
    </div>
    <div class="footer-text">
      helping medical science to flourish
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
